[{"title":"万年春 梦得一枝白笔","author":"马钰","text":"昨夜山侗，梦游蓬岛逢钟吕。\n文房数。\n一枝纯素。\n不让蒙恬做。\n远胜江淹，五色何曾污。\n相宜处。\n书心开悟。\n堪应三清举。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":909,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"万年春 赠斗门李公","author":"马钰","text":"不须远远远寻师，自是神仙自是师。\n真净真清真至理，至微至妙至真师。\n爱憎不尽难求道，人我仍存枉拜师。\n你意不能随我意，我心怎做你心师。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":910,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"万年春 赠兴国寺修塔僧","author":"马钰","text":"物外高僧，澄澄湛湛真禅刹。\n真禅刹。\n心无察察。\n理趣常搜刷。\n玉性玲珑，处处皆通达。\n皆通达。\n无拘无辖。\n垒起黄金塔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":911,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"万年春 赠陈知命","author":"马钰","text":"地肺陈公，白毫显出非常异。\n人难比。\n希夷苗裔。\n肯著尘凡累。\n猛舍家缘，物外搜玄理。\n清心意。\n自然浇溉。\n太一冲和气。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":912,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"三光会合 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"乡关不住。\n谨依教语。\n脱身要归去。\n何思何虑。\n略而分诉。\n任他魔阻。\n丹诚显露。\n真心定处。\n云朋霞友聚。\n修行美事，在乎勤做。\n九转大功数。\n无中要取。\n个中敷布。\n得瞻眉宇。\n可登云路。\n性灵昭著。\n神仙自是度。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":913,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上丹霄 次重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"遇风仙，心开悟，骋颠狂。\n黜妻屏子便迎祥。\n逍遥坦荡，恣情吟咏谩成章。\n就中行化觅知友，同共闻香。\n烹丹鼎，下丹结，中丹热，大丹凉。\n不须炼白更烧黄。\n自然玉性，万般霞彩射人光。\n上丹霄，去住蓬岛，永永圆方。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":914,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"女冠子","author":"马钰","text":"人命无常，看青云、雨过山水。\n韶华尽过了，百年如梦，有似希夷。\n忘情绝爱念，好把意马心猿牢系。\n绵绵密密。\n有似出息。\n常不保入息。\n十年一似修真理。\n做神仙、万无一失。\n门生莫生疑。\n若有纤毫虚谬，马风罚作阴山为鬼。\n心行常不昧。\n遍十方、观照天地。\n累成功行，自有金童来认你。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":915,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五灵妙仙 借柳词韵","author":"马钰","text":"马风宁海，遇重阳十八。\n憨憨地、就中奸黠。\n六尘绝。\n纵逍遥自在，开怀豁畅，云游水历，琼瑶路如冰滑。\n□□补天缺。\n下功收五彩，经营活雪。\n调龙虎、撞关冲节。\n得真悦。\n见晴空莹净，圆圆正正，光辉晃朗，元来自家心月。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":916,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五灵妙仙 赠众道友","author":"马钰","text":"马风重，恳告诸公道友。\n休迷假、内容堪守。\n要长久。\n用真功全在，清心净意，擒猿捉马，休令暂时游走。\n□□得无漏。\n气精神会合，丹砂结就。\n无中相、自然开口。\n论无有。\n这玄玄妙纱，怡然悟解，元来却是，真师暗中传授。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":917,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五灵妙仙 赠扶风县淡公","author":"马钰","text":"悟来降，我相街前乞八。\n飍飍地、似痴如黠。\n万缘绝。\n净清中恣饮，刀圭烂醉，灵台皎洁，惺洒自然光滑。\n□□本无缺。\n玉炉金鼎内，黄芽白雪。\n真龙虎，绕幡关节。\n姹婴悦。\n把昆仑顶戴，冲开云雾，天无昼夜，长显一轮明月。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":918,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五灵妙仙 赠赵八先生","author":"马钰","text":"马风词，拜上真宁赵八。\n常清净、内容娇黠。\n马猿绝。\n处无为无作，通玄达妙，琼浆得饮，馨香味兼甘滑。\n□□无盈缺。\n自然神气壮，眠卧冰雪。\n欺寒暑、不拘时节。\n这般悦。\n自心知意解，难言难说，逍遥坦荡，清了洞天真月。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":919,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五灵妙仙 赠蓬瀛散人","author":"马钰","text":"愿贤增寿，算家豪散八。\n儿孙孝、尽皆奸黠。\n总超绝。\n效庞公许氏，全家顿悟，同登彼岸，长生路途清滑。\n□□兔角缺。\n往来游戏，看天花瑞雪。\n金茎秀、迥无枝节。\n个中悦。\n是灵童应净，真乐真乐，无愁可解，唯吟绛霄风月。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":920,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凤栖梧","author":"马钰","text":"范蠡张良当日悟。\n得宠还惊，防患寻归路。\n若恋功名尖险处。\n如何却得蓬庄住。\n或问扶风缘甚去。\n京兆风仙，远远亲来度。\n便觉灵明常有主。\n从今直入长生户。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":921,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"凤栖梧","author":"马钰","text":"物外逍遥修九九。\n慕乐清贫，寂净无中有。\n不谒侯门常内守。\n脱离天地人三彀。\n子午门封真卯酉。\n白虎青龙，对凤频哮吼。\n佛面婴儿披锦绶。\n蓬瀛路上堪游走。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":922,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"化生儿 和重阳真人","author":"马钰","text":"得遇忻然别东州。\n访地肺，恣遨游。\n水云自在没忧愁。\n这攀援，爱念休。\n保护根元二尾牛。\n运玉汞，倒颠流。\n金丹结正不持修。\n阐玄谈，般若舟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":923,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天道无亲 劝公道友","author":"马钰","text":"奉劝离俗修持，自有清清雨。\n雨变雪花飞，得见青莲浦。\n陪伴脱尘云霞侣。\n不要起、攀缘心绪。\n莫恋金笼共鹦鹉。\n听马风真语。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":924,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天道无亲 本名甘草子劝众道友","author":"马钰","text":"唯愿。\n想像庄周，梦蝶飞轻粉。\n悟彻本无亲，天道堪凭信。\n一志寂寥修行紧。\n便莫惜、假躯娇嫩。\n捐弃家缘须陡顿。\n任女男妻恨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":925,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"心月照云溪 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"死生生死，镇日常惊怕。\n忽尔遇风仙，便说开、些儿妙话。\n忻然顿觉，猛烈弃家缘，向无中，铸经营，烹炼丹无价。\n投真得趣，自是增惺洒。\n方寸要清凉，把尘缘、般般放下。\n颐神养气，心月照云溪，处无私，凭真实，无谄亦无诈。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":926,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"心月照云溪 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"一心离俗，二气调和宝。\n清净聚三光，四时花、五方运造。\n断除六欲，不使七情牵，持八戒，九关通，十载功须到。\n十年锻炼，九变金光草。\n八脉总和匀，有七圣、六丁助道。\n五行咄出，四假不中留，礼三清，成不二，一性投仙岛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":927,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"心月照云溪 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"我今得遇，便向难中做。\n决要脱家缘，细寻思、不堪回顾。\n黜妻屏子，绝利更忘名，离乡关，归物外，称个超然悟。\n马猿捉住。\n修葺真园所。\n岂敢恋冤亲，要龟蛇、时时厮觑。\n援其性命，出自太原公，掌元初，成圆相，踏碎根源路。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":928,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆王孙","author":"马钰","text":"麻衣纸袄度冬寒。\n暖阁红炉永不堪。\n认正些儿理端的。\n气神安。\n结就无为九转丹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":929,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆王孙","author":"马钰","text":"长安云步去还来。\n万朵金莲火里开。\n独饮刀圭胜浊醅。\n两三杯。\n涤尽凡心有甚灾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":930,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆王孙 次重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"方知口是是非门。\n紧闭牢藏舌祸根。\n训我无言更不论。\n削迷昏。\n性命从今永永存。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":931,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆王孙 和重阳真人","author":"马钰","text":"心清步步入玄门。\n意静霰霰溉本根。\n蓦地听闻没口论。\n性无昏。\n一点灵光万劫存。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":932,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆王孙 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"风仙师父妙谈论。\n说透无为清净门。\n舌上甘津味得吞。\n溉精魂。\n阴里阳生万劫行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":933,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"斗修行 本名斗百花犯正宫","author":"马钰","text":"同流宜斗修行，斗把刚强摧挫。\n斗降心忘，酒色财气人我。\n斗不还乡，时时斗悟清贫，逍遥。\n放慵闲过。\n斗要成功果。\n斗没纤尘，斗进长生真火。\n斗炼七返九还，灿烂丹颗。\n斗起慈悲、常常似斗无争，斗早得携云朵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":934,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无调名 次重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"醉中醒。\n睡中惊。\n暗中明。\n个中平。\n心开悟，得前程。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":935,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无调名 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"重阳仙，设芋栗。\n赠我夫妻莫前失。\n要知命。\n要知性。\n从此超凡要入圣。\n妙玄知。\n妙玄知。\n身中子午倒颠时。\n水乡无漏金丹结，自然云步赴瑶池。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":936,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无调名 赠王公叠字调","author":"马钰","text":"运三车，入宝瓶。\n花灿烂，玉堂明。\n光照耀，鬼神惊。\n散阴魔，精自秘。\n藏丹颗，性灵灵。\n明出现，绝多能。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":937,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"无调名 赠风翔酒郎中","author":"马钰","text":"杜康造底。\n昔日文君，当垆沽底。\n蓦想古业毕卓，亲曾偷底。\n是刘伶，十分偏爱底。\n帝前李白曾吐底。\n栾巴起慈，救火遥噀底。\n司马相公，常常专专诫底。\n又争知，是郎中贵姓底。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":938,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玉楼春 和师韵","author":"马钰","text":"诸公日日闲团聚。\n饭罢时时眼厮觑。\n专专惟望马风言，怎敢玄玄轻泄露。\n常常只把气神护。\n谨谨调和龙虎步。\n徐徐炼就九还丹，个个成仙云外去。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":939,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"水云游 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"玉性玉性。\n玉户牢封，金门紧钉。\n玉房中、见个骊龙，玉虎来吞并。\n玉关能启通捷径。\n玉童传宣令。\n玉皇天、至矣无私，玉诏今番定。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":940,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"水云游 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"思算思算。\n妻妾儿孙，休来戏玩。\n这冤亲、系脚绳儿，宜一刀两段。\n灵源悟彻元灿烂。\n这一番更换。\n马风子、辞别家乡，与风仙作伴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":941,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"水云游（北曲） 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"不住不住。\n火院当离，深宜别户。\n害风仙、化我扃门，这修行须做。\n腥膻戒尽常餐素。\n挂体唯麻布。\n待百朝、锁钥开时，效吾师内顾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":942,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"马山侗。\n马山侗。\n与个丘仙和不同。\n心交有始终。\n合西东。\n合西东。\n慧目相看别有功。\n时时现内容。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":943,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"屋贪多。\n地贪多。\n不若灰心厌事多。\n崇真利益多。\n天如何。\n地如何。\n富贵荣华待若何。\n轮回奈我何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":944,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"紫芝汤。\n紫芝汤。\n一遍煎时一遍香。\n一杯万事忘。\n神砂汤。\n神砂汤。\n服罢主宾分两厢。\n携云现玉皇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":945,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"梦轩辕。\n弃田园。\n难继夷门孟四元。\n惟修性月圆。\n缚心猿。\n认根源。\n小小蛇儿俯视鼋。\n阳纯礼太原。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":946,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"爇银釭。\n龙虎降。\n自在逍遥吸九江。\n从思恶肉腔。\n结红霜。\n赴蓬庄。\n万朵金莲簇宝幢。\n方知好道庞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":947,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"入南京。\n赴蓬瀛。\n显出王风九转成。\n超然得上升。\n宠何荣。\n辱何惊。\n三髻山侗绝利名。\n何愁性不灵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":948,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"遇重阳。\n牧青羊。\n不著虚名远远扬。\n惟修性日旸。\n慕荀扬。\n乐飘扬。\n豁豁洋洋豁豁洋。\n通玄风害佯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":949,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"朝清清。\n暮清清。\n清净清闲清净清。\n清清清更清。\n抱灵灵。\n固灵灵。\n灵显灵明灵显灵。\n灵灵灵更灵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":950,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"正家丰。\n不争锋。\n猛烈灰心王害风。\n先归三岛峰。\n马山侗。\n过临潼。\n三髻头梳似小童。\n专专化个同。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":951,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"垒浮图。\n垒浮图。\n悟彻浮生恶假躯。\n回头认本初。\n莫踟蹰。\n莫踌蹰。\n急急修完无价珠。\n功成蓬岛居。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":952,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"遇重阳。\n梦纯阳。\n爇起心香礼正阳。\n三师助我阳。\n炼阴阳。\n固元阳。\n五色霞光簇太阳。\n云中子抱阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":953,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"酒初醒。\n梦初惊。\n幻化何须恋利名。\n灰心远世情。\n月初明。\n性初平。\n倒溯清流过玉京。\n黄芽渐渐荣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":954,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"马钰","text":"功要圆。\n行要圆。\n修炼身中子母圆。\n何愁性不圆。\n喜团圆。\n十分圆。\n云水风邀月正圆。\n无分昼夜圆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":955,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 与刘处玄并示孟四元","author":"马钰","text":"看阳刘。\n看阳刘。\n福杖心持占岸头。\n眠云枕逆流。\n万缘休。\n万缘休。\n金木相生性转柔。\n丹成赴十洲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":956,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 往南京搬取风仙灵衬","author":"马钰","text":"马风乾。\n有微言。\n一别风仙恰二年。\n思心似倒县。\n去无缘。\n阙盘缠。\n乞化长安自肯钱。\n成人在众贤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":957,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 茶","author":"马钰","text":"一枪茶。\n二旗茶。\n休献机心名利家。\n无眠为作差。\n无为茶。\n自然茶。\n天赐休心与道家。\n无眠功行加。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":958,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 寄长春子丘通密","author":"马钰","text":"长思仙。\n长思仙。\n思忆长春子最贤。\n何时得面圆。\n展花笺。\n展花笺。\n写就清吟三两篇。\n专凭鸾鹤传。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":959,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 赠小张仙","author":"马钰","text":"小张仙。\n小张仙。\n款款搜寻汞与铅。\n先须缚马猿。\n气绵绵。\n气绵绵。\n龙虎相交玉蕊鲜。\n金丹一粒圆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":960,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 赠六曲社丁李张三道友","author":"马钰","text":"休哀人。\n休哀人。\n急急灰心哀自身。\n回头结善因。\n早搜真。\n早搜真。\n营养身中神内神。\n功成礼洞宾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":961,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 赠任仙","author":"马钰","text":"左擎苍。\n右牵黄。\n昔日存心飞走忙。\n如今万事忘。\n饮琼浆。\n宴明堂。\n瑞气祥光入绛房。\n无中得弄璋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":962,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 赠众女姑","author":"马钰","text":"女姑听。\n女姑听。\n学取麻姑至净清。\n依他妙善行。\n莫惺惺。\n莫惺惺。\n外做憨痴内自灵。\n功成赴玉京。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":963,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 赠零口权先生","author":"马钰","text":"出家儿。\n处无为。\n至死如同初出时。\n何愁道不知。\n内慈悲，外憨痴。\n绝虑忘机无执迷。\n刀圭有分携。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":964,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"长相思 赠魏害风","author":"马钰","text":"害风仙。\n害风仙。\n万事俱忘理太玄。\n调和汞与铅。\n结金莲。\n结金莲。\n九转功成性月圆。\n超凡入洞天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":965,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"风马儿 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"意马颠狂自由纵。\n来往走、珰滴琉玎。\n更加之、心猿厮调弄。\n歌迷酒惑财色引，珰滴琉玎。\n幸遇风仙把持鞚。\n便不敢、珰滴琉玎。\n待清清、堪归云霞洞。\n浑身白彻再不肯，珰滴琉玎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":966,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"平等会 本名相思会继古韵","author":"马钰","text":"信口便胡轰，不管无腔调。\n畅我情怀歌舞，一任人笑。\n还童返老。\n志在无忧恼。\n向妙处，下功搜，细勘校。\n琼浆恣饮，元气充来饱。\n锻炼神丹，无大无小。\n胎仙养就，捧出灵芝草。\n便自炫，这番儿，道决了。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":967,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玉女摇仙佩 次重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"我今得遇，把气财并酒色，心中常涤。\n缚马擒猿，牢封紧闭。\n唯恐精光觑滴。\n渐渐知空寂。\n况余今已向，下坡年历。\n当归道、相宜进迪。\n俗念尘情，慧剑频劈。\n凭师教，通关节，要功夫、勤勤妙绩。\n调引乌龟赤凤，搬运青龙白虎，同成幽阒。\n个内得乎，真欢真乐，更不闲搜闲觅。\n应自然符檄。\n烹炼三丹，灵锋鸣镝。\n便散尽、妖魔罢敌。\n永成嘉趣，性增明晰。\n无忧戚。\n蓬莱路、幸知端的。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":968,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玉花洞 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"得其真遇，怎敢怠慢，勤修功果。\n紧擒意马，无令颠劣，便把心猿锁。\n逢魔逢难全然可。\n盖谓无烟火。\n本师说破。\n元初这个。\n争甚闲人我。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":969,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玉京山 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"慷慨男儿跳出来。\n名缰并利锁，豁然开。\n宜乎了干死生灾。\n超彼岸，休望再头回。\n师父教方催。\n道装当结裹，没心推。\n任教妻子哭哀哀。\n关西去，做个驾云材。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":970,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玉炉三涧雪 继重阳韵","author":"马钰","text":"火院出离勇猛，发心急救残生。\n丹田难仗本师耕。\n岂敢常怀徼幸。\n得遇明明有幸，通玄暗暗勤行。\n便教日午打三更。\n玉里掏开金矿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":971,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]